    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n\nREA Dooley Group are delighted to present this charming detached two bedroom residence extending to approximately 93 sq.m. (1,001 sq.ft.), offering a wonderful blend of character, comfort and countryside living. \n\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, the accommodation is bright and welcoming, with many attractive features including timber flooring, vaulted timber ceilings and dual aspect windows that flood the interior with natural light.\n\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, cosy sitting room with feature fireplace, shower room, spacious living/dining room with double doors opening onto the rear decking area, fitted kitchen, two bedrooms, a family bathroom and a separate outside utility room.\n\n Heating is provided by efficient Haverland electric heating.\n\n \n\nExternally, the property enjoys a private rear decking area, ideal for outdoor dining and entertaining, together with the convenience of a detached utility room. \n\nSituated in the picturesque village of Grange, this property enjoys the tranquillity of rural living while remaining highly accessible. Limerick City is located just 15 minutes away, providing a full range of shopping, educational and recreational amenities. The nearby town of Bruff is approximately 5.5 km away, while a regular bus service to and from Limerick City passes the property several times daily. \n\nThis delightful home will appeal to a wide range of purchasers including first-time buyers, those seeking to downsize, or anyone looking for a peaceful countryside retreat within easy reach of the city.\n\n\nViewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with the selling agent.\n\nFolio: LK15033\n\nEntrance Hallway - 16'5 (5m) x 6'7 (2.01m)\nTimber floor ceiling with recess lighting\n\nSitting Room - 15'9 (4.8m) x 12'2 (3.71m)\nFireplace, Timber ceiling with recess lighting, Timber floor, Dual aspect windows\n\nShower Room - 5'11 (1.8m) x 3'0 (0.91m)\nWC, WHB, walk in shower, fully tiled\n\nLiving / Dining Room - 15'9 (4.8m) x 9'10 (3m)\nTimber floor and ceiling with recess lighting, double doors to decking area\n\nKitchen - 9'10 (3m) x 6'3 (1.91m)\nFitted kitchen, Timber floor and ceiling, Tiled walls\n\nBedroom 1 - 11'10 (3.61m) x 12'2 (3.71m)\nTimber vaulted ceiling, WHB, Dual aspect windows\n\nBathroom - 8'6 (2.59m) x 5'7 (1.7m)\nWC, WHB, Bath with shower, Hotpress, Timber ceiling\n\nBedroom 2\nTimber vaulted ceiling, WHB, Dual aspect windows\n\nOutside Utility Room - 6'11 (2.11m) x 6'7 (2.01m)\nSS Sink, Plumbed for washer/dryer\n\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
